{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Internet culture!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game mocks new and old internet culture by making enemies that represent the worst of their subculture</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dodge and hit!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you perfectly dodge a attack you counterattack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346580/extras/DodgeAndHit.gif?t=1746535309\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gradual HP loss for you and enemies!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">if your HP is red, do not panic! you can heal yourself if your HP is not 0, but enemies can so do that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346580/extras/HealRed.gif?t=1746535309\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Without pretentious themes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We know these type of games, so we decided not using pretentious themes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Demo included features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>Base mode</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>The first act of the official world</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>Combat</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>Character leveling</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>Co-op</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Full version features that are not in the demo:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>Whole official world</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>Extra worlds made by the community</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>Level editor</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>Versus Mode</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>More enemies</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>More bosses</u></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steam